    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/ac38e1bcf33b2b0ae1f9a0b16a8f5b29.poster.avif?t=1750639590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/ac38e1bcf33b2b0ae1f9a0b16a8f5b29.webm?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/ac38e1bcf33b2b0ae1f9a0b16a8f5b29.mp4?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A classic late-90s / early 2000s narrative driven survival-horror game, set in a fictional universe full of century old mysteries to uncover.<br>You play as Douglas Hayles, the one who bears the mark of the king of shades and tasked with an impossible mission that cannot be achieved within a single lifespan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/23ea0a9838b0ce04775261ee8a8e0d7e.poster.avif?t=1750639590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/23ea0a9838b0ce04775261ee8a8e0d7e.webm?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/23ea0a9838b0ce04775261ee8a8e0d7e.mp4?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose both the combat and puzzle difficulty according to your preferences.<br></li><li>Cinematic fixed camera level design.<br></li><li>Classic tank controls movement system.<br></li><li>Limited supplies and inventory space.<br></li><li>Limited amount of lives per play-through, every decision you make has a cost.<br></li><li>In real-time resource management, preparation before every engagement is key to survival.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/5440999a4e16ea06f88a888ebaa9021d.avif?t=1750639590\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/5b8c54f0deea4d1eb76ca3955ba477be.avif?t=1750639590\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/ac38e1bcf33b2b0ae1f9a0b16a8f5b29.poster.avif?t=1750639590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/ac38e1bcf33b2b0ae1f9a0b16a8f5b29.webm?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/ac38e1bcf33b2b0ae1f9a0b16a8f5b29.mp4?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A classic late-90s / early 2000s narrative driven survival-horror game, set in a fictional universe full of century old mysteries to uncover.<br>You play as Douglas Hayles, the one who bears the mark of the king of shades and tasked with an impossible mission that cannot be achieved within a single lifespan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/23ea0a9838b0ce04775261ee8a8e0d7e.poster.avif?t=1750639590\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/23ea0a9838b0ce04775261ee8a8e0d7e.webm?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/23ea0a9838b0ce04775261ee8a8e0d7e.mp4?t=1750639590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose both the combat and puzzle difficulty according to your preferences.<br></li><li>Cinematic fixed camera level design.<br></li><li>Classic tank controls movement system.<br></li><li>Limited supplies and inventory space.<br></li><li>Limited amount of lives per play-through, every decision you make has a cost.<br></li><li>In real-time resource management, preparation before every engagement is key to survival.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/5440999a4e16ea06f88a888ebaa9021d.avif?t=1750639590\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504640/extras/5b8c54f0deea4d1eb76ca3955ba477be.avif?t=1750639590\" /></span>",
